      "id": 150650,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-11-19T18:40:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just wondering if anyone has the answer, or is willing to find out for me (since right now I can't run SOTM the video game)If you put Embolden on Expatriette, and with Expat's first power you use Prejudice, using its effect to use the powr on Pride, does that count as your two powers, or do you still get another power use?Thanks ahead of time for an answer.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That counts as your Two Powers. You have to use the guns in the reverse order to shoot 3 times. Use Prejudice first, then using Pride as your second power auto-grants you the free Prej use.</p>",
